  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, whisk together yogurt, mustard, cayenne pepper, and coriander.",
    "Add the diced red onion, garlic, and ginger to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Add the chicken breast to the bowl and mix until coated.",
    "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chicken to the skillet and cook until browned and cooked through.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix together honey and melted butter.",
    "Brush the flatbread with the honey-butter mixture.",
    "Assemble the wrap by placing the cooked chicken down the center of the flatbread.",
    "Add the cucumber and lettuce on top of the chicken.",
    "Fold the flatbread in half to enclose the filling.",
    "Serve immediately."
  ],
